# Bundled build output — regenerated by `bun run build`; do not review line-by-line.
# The bundles are committed with LF; normalise on checkout so a Windows working
# tree does not show spurious diffs in `bun run build:check`.
xdomains/scripts/** linguist-generated=true -diff text eol=lf
# Generated context docs — rendered by `bun run build:docs` and drift-checked by `bun run build:check`.
.opencode/context/** linguist-generated=true -diff text eol=lf
# Resolved multi-axis agent variants (ADR-0020) — generated by the shared
# templating tool from `<Base>.md` + `<Base>_manifest.json`; parity-checked by
# `tests/unity-skills.test.ts`. LF so a Windows checkout does not drift.
xdomains/game-dev/**/agent/**/*.sk.md linguist-generated=true -diff text eol=lf
xdomains/game-dev/**/agent/**/*.nsk.md linguist-generated=true -diff text eol=lf
